<!--tz-meta {"id":"ex-footer","title":"Footer — Lighthouse","category":"Elixir","file":"elixir/footer.heex","tags":["heex","phoenix","footer","editorial","typographic"],"description":"The lighthouse footer: a foghorn-sized Anton wordmark under signal-red rules, columns set like tide charts, honest small print.","dnas":["harbor-fog"]} -->
<%!-- def footer(assigns) — attr :wordmark, :string, default: "LATCH" · attr :columns, :list — each: %{title: string, links: list of %{label: string, href: string}} · attr :tagline, :string · attr :locale_line, :string --%>
<%!--
Design read: The lighthouse footer — a foghorn-sized wordmark rolling in under signal-red rules, link columns set like tide charts, and small print that actually says something.
Distinctive choice: the 17vw wordmark cropped at the viewport's bottom edge, so the brand looms like a hull in fog.
Dials: VARIANCE 6 / MOTION 1 / DENSITY 6. DNA: harbor-fog (Anton / Karla / IBM Plex Mono).
--%>
<style>
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Karla:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap");
.tz-foot {
  --tz-bg: #e8e6df;
  --tz-ink: #2b3138;
  --tz-muted: #7d838a;
  --tz-accent: #c33a2c;
  --tz-line: #2b31381f;
  --tz-font-display: "Anton", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
  --tz-font-body: "Karla", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
  --tz-font-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", "SFMono-Regular", monospace;
  background: var(--tz-bg);
  color: var(--tz-ink);
  font-family: var(--tz-font-body);
  border-top: 3px solid var(--tz-accent);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.tz-foot__inner { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 4rem) 0; }
.tz-foot__top {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);
  padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
}
.tz-foot__brand p.tz-foot__tagline {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  max-width: 30ch;
  margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
}
.tz-foot__signal {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.6rem;
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--tz-muted);
}
.tz-foot__signal-dot {
  width: 9px;
  height: 9px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--tz-accent);
}
.tz-foot__col-title {
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--tz-muted);
  margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  padding-bottom: 0.7rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tz-line);
}
.tz-foot__col ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.65rem; }
.tz-foot__col a {
  color: var(--tz-ink);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
}
.tz-foot__col a:hover { color: var(--tz-accent); border-bottom-color: var(--tz-accent); }
.tz-foot__legal {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 1rem 2.5rem;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--tz-line);
  padding: 1.4rem 0;
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--tz-muted);
}
.tz-foot__legal p { margin: 0; }
.tz-foot__wordmark {
  font-family: var(--tz-font-display);
  font-size: 17.5vw;
  line-height: 0.8;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--tz-ink);
  margin: 1rem 0 -0.16em;
  text-align: center;
  user-select: none;
}
.tz-foot__wordmark .tz-foot__wm-dot { color: var(--tz-accent); }
@media (max-width: 1000px) {
  .tz-foot__top { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .tz-foot__top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .tz-foot__wordmark { font-size: 24vw; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .tz-foot__col a { transition: none; }
}
</style>
<footer class="tz-foot">
  <div class="tz-foot__inner">
    <div class="tz-foot__top">
      <div class="tz-foot__brand">
        <p class="tz-foot__tagline">{@tagline}</p>
        <span class="tz-foot__signal"><span class="tz-foot__signal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> All systems nominal</span>
      </div>
      {for col <- @columns do}
        <nav class="tz-foot__col" aria-label={col.title}>
          <h3 class="tz-foot__col-title">{col.title}</h3>
          <ul>
            {for l <- col.links do}
              <li><.link href={l.href}>{l.label}</.link></li>
            {/for}
          </ul>
        </nav>
      {/for}
    </div>
    <div class="tz-foot__legal">
      <p>© 2026 Latch Systems, Inc. — invoices paid, friendships kept.</p>
      <p>{@locale_line}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tz-foot__wordmark" aria-hidden="true">{@wordmark}<span class="tz-foot__wm-dot">.</span></div>
  </div>
</footer>
